@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@customerId = 1
@planId = 1
@jobCode = REPLACE_FROM_JOBS

### Shop
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/route/shop

### Customer (copy last_id from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"ลูกค้าทดสอบ","phone":"0800000000","address":"หน้ามหาวิทยาลัย","latitude":16.247,"longitude":103.251}

### Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{"customer_id":{{customerId}},"quantity":2,"order_date":"2026-10-08"}

### Calculate and save plan (requires a rider in DB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/route/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{"delivery_date":"2026-10-08","rider_count":1}

### Plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/route/plans/{{planId}}

### Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs

### Job detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{jobCode}}
